{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_4","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc 'git status --short; cat docs/agents/roles/orchestrator.md; cat docs/agents/team.md'","aggregated_output":"git: warning: confstr() failed with code 5: couldn't get path of DARWIN_USER_TEMP_DIR; using /tmp instead\ngit: error: couldn't create cache file '/tmp/xcrun_db-aSnE0aBz' (errno=Operation not permitted)\n2026-11-06 00:01:46.306 xcodebuild[48118:111271454]  DVTFilePathFSEvents: Failed to start fs event stream.\n2026-11-06 00:01:46.687 xcodebuild[48118:111271453] [MT] DVTDeveloperPaths: Failed to get length of DARWIN_USER_CACHE_DIR from confstr(3), error = Error Domain=NSPOSIXErrorDomain Code=5 \"Input/output error\". Using NSCachesDirectory instead.\ngit: warning: confstr() failed with code 5: couldn't get path of DARWIN_USER_TEMP_DIR; using /tmp instead\ngit: error: couldn't create cache file '/tmp/xcrun_db-bsvPW2rn' (errno=Operation not permitted)\n2026-11-06 00:01:47.894 xcodebuild[48124:111271478]  DVTFilePathFSEvents: Failed to start fs event stream.\n2026-11-06 00:01:48.179 xcodebuild[48124:111271477] [MT] DVTDeveloperPaths: Failed to get length of DARWIN_USER_CACHE_DIR from confstr(3), error = Error Domain=NSPOSIXErrorDomain Code=5 \"Input/output error\". Using NSCachesDirectory instead.\n?? .flutter-plugins-dependencies\n?? BRIEF-j6g-mob.md\n?? collab/1793546000000-engineer-node-shard-uncovered-skip.kimi-k3.1-pro.findings.md\n?? collab/1793546000000-engineer-node-shard-uncovered-skip.kimi-k3.1-pro.stdout.log\n?? collab/1793546000000-engineer-node-shard-uncovered-skip.prompt.md\n?? collab/1794530000000-engineer-hooks-fixture-fix.gpt-6-luna.stdout.log\n?? collab/jolt/1794095000000-reviewer-j6g-mob-astra.brief.md\n?? collab/orch-lane/1794400000000-architect-eval-bridge-design.gpt-6.1-sol.stdout.log\n?? collab/orch-lane/1794410000000-engineer-p8-manifest-repair.muse-spark-1.3.stdout.log\n?? collab/orch-lane/1794430000000-engineer-p8-manifest-repair.muse-spark-1.