il))\n2884:  \"The `compile-program` opts a linked unit compiles with: the\n3004:   preamble `compile-program` emits defines those names locally, and\n3011:         program (compile-program (concat source library) true unit-opts)\n2:{[latte-kernel.defenv/registered-definition? 1] \"No passing direct fixture or named integration records this exact arity in both C lanes.\"}\n./src/cljc/yin/vm/ucf/ledger.cljc\n./src/cljc/yin/vm/ledger.cljc\n34:                               ;; latte-kernel: the LaTTe proof assistant's kernel,\n37:                               latte-kernel/latte-kernel\n38:                               {:git/url \"https://github.com/latte-central/latte-kernel\"\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
